==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Cognate Swedish {{term|tio|lang=sv}}, Danish {{term|ti|lang=da}} and English {{term|-ty|lang=en}} (as in {{term|twenty|twen'''ty'''}}, {{term|thirty|thir'''ty'''}}, {{term|forty|for'''ty'''}}, etc.). 
===Numeral===
'''tíu''' {{indecl}}

# '''[[ten]]'''; the cardinal number after [[níu#Icelandic|níu]] and before [[ellefu#Icelandic|ellefu]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[tíundi]] {{m}}, [[tíunda]] {{f|n}}

